      <div class="archived-comment-body"><p>I do my best remove as many meetings as possible in order to support development. Even slides and presentations I keep the details short and up front to encourage discuss and get people back to developing the product. I am going to implement this with my team as I have been looking for a better way to share information without overloading everyone.</p><p>I get concerned when employees say they do not understand what leadership is doing. They know we are busy but do not have a window into the details, hopefully this can provide that.</p></div>
